     ["Pump power to genset sizing to lift traffic — in the workspace, not a spreadsheet", "Every result carries the formula it used", "The Assistant uses the same calculators in documents"]),
    ("ai", "Assistant & AI", "Grounded, honest", "assistant.webp", "assistant.html",
     "A project-grounded assistant that searches your evidence, calculates with verified formulas and writes deliverables on your letterhead — with per-user AI accounts, badged and billed honestly.",
     ["Cites (document, p.X) — or says ⟨TBC⟩, never invents", "Keeps your company template's cover, footer and contents", "Each user brings their own AI key; local features never need one"]),
    ("plat", "Platform", "The operating system", "tour.webp", "platform.html",
