- {SITE}/pricing.html — the two plans: personal monthly and company annual
- {SITE}/dashboard.html, /workflow.html, /registers.html, /pour.html, /search.html,
  /comms.html, /studios.html, /calculators.html, /assistant.html,
  /platform.html — module deep-dives
- {SITE}/proven.html — the numbers and how each was measured
